{"id": "EUVD-2026-98012", "enisaUuid": "fe11a4ae-633e-39d8-84df-ea082e27381d", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.120.0 and 16.x before 16.23.0 contains an authorization bypass in an endpoint that honours a caller-supplied flag disabling its own permission enforcement. Authenticated attackers can set this flag when calling the endpoint to skip permission checks and read party records beyond their permitted role.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T14:11:57", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-wwgm-3pv3-gmqh", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-15.120.0-unauthorized-party-record-access-via-permission-bypass"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109621", "GHSA-g24j-j8m9-65fg"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8d93be64-9404-3131-9402-e09e59dbb53e", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.120.0"}, {"id": "e68d873d-cd10-300e-9f14-83cde9d2524f", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.23.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "54892203-1462-3c35-871e-b7ba1195a921", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}